# B   @northgate/canopy-ui 3.7.2 -> 4.0.0  (commit 4aa0baa, MBZ-2210 hop 2; dependency tree only)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   - Canopy 4.0.0 built from northgate-canopy-ui feature/CNPY-2140-angular-14-to-15 (PR #3) and published to the
#     local Verdaccio (4873) only. Its peers are @angular/* ^15.2, @angular/material ^15.2, rxjs ^7.5, so
#     package.json moves to the Angular 15.2 / Material 15.2 / CDK 15.2 set in the same commit. The source
#     migration is the next commit (C); the pin alone does not compile against Angular 14 sources, so B's gates
#     are C's gates.
#   - @angular/flex-layout 14.0.0-beta.41 REMOVED (zero fx*/FlexLayoutModule usages in src/,
#     00-baseline-14/flex-layout-inventory.log; it was a Canopy 3.x peer and blocked the Material 15 resolve).
