#     typography overrides found, nothing to do" - business-web never overrode Canopy typography levels, so the
#     Material-2014 -> Material-15 level rename (KAN-33 risk) does not touch this repository.
#   - styles.scss theme entry stays `@use '@northgate/canopy-ui/themes' as canopy; @include canopy.theme();`
#     The 4.0.0 `styles` entry forwards `../lib/tokens` / `../lib/themes`, which are not in the published package
