#   - @angular/cli "Remove options from angular.json no longer supported": no change.
#   - @angular/core "relativeLinkResolution removed": no change (never set).
#   - @angular/core "RouterLink contains RouterLinkWithHref": no change (no direct RouterLinkWithHref import).
